# ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# Optional: skillsmp.com API key
# ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
#
# IMPORTANT: An API key is NOT required to be listed on skillsmp.com.
#
# skillsmp.com is a passive crawler that automatically indexes public GitHub
# repos containing SKILL.md files. This skill is listed automatically once
# this repo is public and contains a well-formed SKILL.md with YAML
# frontmatter. No account, no submission form, no API key needed for listing.
#
# The optional free API key below is only needed if you want to *consume*
# the skillsmp.com read REST API at higher rate limits in your own tooling:
#   - Anonymous access:    50 requests/day
#   - Authenticated access: 500 requests/day
#
# To obtain one (optional): visit https://skillsmp.com
#
# SKILLSMP_API_KEY=smp_your_optional_key_here
